    transcript: "Teacher: Let's talk about your future plans. What will you do if you finish university?\nStudent 1: If I get my degree, I will start my own business.\nTeacher: What kind of business?\nStudent 1: If I have enough money, I will open a café in the city centre.\nTeacher: Great idea! What about you?\nStudent 2: If I pass my exams, I will study abroad.\nTeacher: Which country will you go to?\nStudent 2: If I get a scholarship, I will go to Germany.\nTeacher: And what will you do if you don't get it?\nStudent 2: If I don't get the scholarship, I will study in Tashkent instead.\nTeacher: What about you?\nStudent 3: If my English improves, I will become a translator.\nTeacher: If you all work hard, you will achieve your dreams!",
